[[0,14427,0,9,0,9,"2014-06-29T21:40:00","Rosenkavalier","",[],"<p>Hello everyone, Rosenkavalier here. I'm coming from Reddit, due to reasons concerning mostly a lack of transparency on vote manipulation and moderation. </p>\n<p>I have a wide range of interests, but am mostly interested in news and politics when it comes to sites like this. I am looking forward to being a more active and contributing member here than over on Reddit!</p>\n<p>I am a musician in the US, and that is about all I will tell you all for now! Looking forward to building this community!</p>","Hello all!","","introductions"],[1,13563,0,1,0,1,"2014-06-29T21:58:00","Atko","",[],"<p>Hi and welcome! :) Do you play any instruments and if so, which?</p>"],[1,14090,0,0,0,0,"2014-06-30T23:54:00","Nuciferine","",[],"<p>Nice to have you here.</p>"],[1,1219005,0,0,0,0,"2015-07-21T05:38:12","ownsauce","",[],"<p>Welcome! If you'd like to discover new music, I'm trying to build a community over at <a href=\"https://voat.co/v/republicofmusic\">/v/republicofmusic</a> where everything is 3 months old or newer. Happy voating and <a href=\"http://apollo-na-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/1418533364003/goat_in_a_boat.jpg\">glad you goat here safely.</a></p>"]]
